/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 54 0 R
/T (11. Conclusion  The Amazon Sales Analysis dashboard converts transactional sales data into a practical business  intelligence solution. It combines sales KPIs, product analysis, fulfilment monitoring, customer segmentation and geographical analysis in an interactive Power BI environment. The dashboard can support management in identifying performance patterns, improving operational monitoring and making informed sales and inventory decisions. )
/E (11. Conclusion  The Amazon Sales Analysis dashboard converts transactional sales data into a practical business  intelligence solution. It combines sales KPIs, product analysis, fulfilment monitoring, customer segmentation and geographical analysis in an interactive Power BI environment. The dashboard can support management in identifying performance patterns, improving operational monitoring and making informed sales and inventory decisions. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
