151 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 54 0 R
/T (10. Business Recommendations  1. Prioritize inventory and promotions around consistently high-performing categories and sizes.  2. Use state and city performance to support regional marketing and inventory allocation.  3. Monitor cancelled and unshipped orders to identify operational improvement opportunities.  4. Review fulfilment performance regularly to maintain service quality and control costs.  5. Use monthly sales trends for demand forecasting, campaign planning and inventory preparation.  6. Explore targeted B2B acquisition strategies where business-customer participation is relatively low. 7. Refresh the dashboard periodically so decisions are based on current data. )
/E (10. Business Recommendations  1. Prioritize inventory and promotions around consistently high-performing categories and sizes.  2. Use state and city performance to support regional marketing and inventory allocation.  3. Monitor cancelled and unshipped orders to identify operational improvement opportunities.  4. Review fulfilment performance regularly to maintain service quality and control costs.  5. Use monthly sales trends for demand forecasting, campaign planning and inventory preparation.  6. Explore targeted B2B acquisition strategies where business-customer participation is relatively low. 7. Refresh the dashboard periodically so decisions are based on current data. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
